WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:16.632
A group of bandits loaded a cart with food the next day.

2
00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:23.877
Gildong led them into town.

3
00:00:25.499 --> 00:00:27.060
The buildings looked shabby.

4
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.301
The market stalls were mostly empty.

5
00:00:34.321 --> 00:00:38.762
"This town is really poor," Gildong thought.

6
00:00:41.503 --> 00:00:43.884
An old, thin woman was in the street.

7
00:00:43.904 --> 00:00:46.525
"Do you need some rice?"

8
00:00:47.305 --> 00:00:49.105
Nabi held out a small sack.

9
00:00:50.486 --> 00:00:51.886
The woman's eyes lit up.

10
00:00:51.906 --> 00:00:53.447
"Thank you!"

11
00:00:55.307 --> 00:00:57.308
A few people gathered around the cart.

12
00:01:01.344 --> 00:01:03.345
The thieves handed out more rice.

13
00:01:07.647 --> 00:01:08.788
a little girl cried.

14
00:01:10.649 --> 00:01:12.110
She ran toward the cart.

15
00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:16.972
"Soonhee! We have food!"

16
00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:18.233
Boknam said.

17
00:01:20.474 --> 00:01:22.816
Gildong grabbed a few sacks of rice.

18
00:01:22.836 --> 00:01:27.178
"Here, you can take these home."

19
00:01:27.198 --> 00:01:32.229
"We don't have a house anymore," Soonhee said.

20
00:01:32.249 --> 00:01:35.051
"Oh," Gildong said.

21
00:01:35.071 --> 00:01:37.494
"Then you can stay with us from now on."

22
00:01:40.476 --> 00:01:44.159
While the other bandits handed out food, Gildong looked around.

23
00:01:44.179 --> 00:01:48.143
"I wonder if anyone sells books," he thought.

24
00:01:48.843 --> 00:01:51.065
But he didn't see any books in the market.

25
00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:58.432
He went to a candlemaker's stall to ask.

26
00:01:59.608 --> 00:02:02.611
Suddenly a farmer pushed Gildong aside.

27
00:02:02.631 --> 00:02:06.494
"You sold me bad candles!"

28
00:02:06.935 --> 00:02:09.337
The farmer yelled at the young candlemaker.

29
00:02:10.117 --> 00:02:12.179
He tossed some candles to the ground.

30
00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.062
They cracked open and dirt spilled out.

31
00:02:16.082 --> 00:02:19.105
"Give me back my money!"

32
00:02:21.087 --> 00:02:22.788
The young man shook with fear.

33
00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:24.189
"I'm sorry.

34
00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:26.932
I don't have much wax, and I need money quickly."

35
00:02:28.836 --> 00:02:30.797
Gildong stepped in front of the farmer.

36
00:02:32.137 --> 00:02:33.458
He held out some coins.

37
00:02:34.338 --> 00:02:36.379
"Does this cover the cost of the candles you bought?"

38
00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:40.141
The farmer took the coins and nodded.

39
00:02:40.161 --> 00:02:46.383
"If this guy cheats anyone else, I'll report him to an official!"

40
00:02:50.045 --> 00:02:52.006
The candlemaker looked at Gildong.

41
00:02:52.026 --> 00:02:54.187
"Thank you for helping me."

42
00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:57.388
"It's okay," Gildong said.

43
00:02:58.232 --> 00:03:00.113
"But why do you need money so quickly?"

44
00:03:00.133 --> 00:03:05.154
"I needed food for my sick mother," the man said.

45
00:03:05.174 --> 00:03:08.535
"So I borrowed a small sack of rice from a landowner.

46
00:03:09.715 --> 00:03:10.935
Now I must pay him back."

47
00:03:10.955 --> 00:03:14.856
"I can help you repay him," Gildong said.

48
00:03:17.737 --> 00:03:21.018
They went to the cart, and Gildong grabbed a sack of rice.

49
00:03:22.478 --> 00:03:24.279
The candlemaker looked sheepish.

50
00:03:24.299 --> 00:03:27.740
"I also have to pay him interest.

51
00:03:28.888 --> 00:03:30.869
Every day the rice I owe doubles."

52
00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.670
Gildong blinked.

53
00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:37.292
"You only borrowed one small sack of rice.

54
00:03:38.052 --> 00:03:39.273
How many days has it been?"

55
00:03:39.293 --> 00:03:43.634
"Twenty-two," the man said nervously.

56
00:03:50.717 --> 00:03:51.758
a lot of rice!"

57
00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:53.879
Gildong was shocked.

58
00:03:53.899 --> 00:03:56.480
"I need to pay soon.

59
00:03:57.192 --> 00:04:00.658
Or the landowner will make me his servant," the candlemaker said.

60
00:04:02.241 --> 00:04:03.704
Gildong shook his head.

61
00:04:03.724 --> 00:04:06.789
"The landowner is really unfair.

62
00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.231
Let's go talk to him."
